OL,3,ANorth Korea and Russia open first road
OL,4,Abridge linking both countries
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first road bridge linking Russia
OL,7,Fand North Korea has opened, allowing
OL,8,Fthe two countries to more easily move
OL,9,Fcargo and passengers between their
OL,10,Fborder across the Tumen river.
OL,12,FPyongyang state media said the bridge
OL,13,Fwill be used for "personnel exchanges,
OL,14,Ftourism and trade".
OL,16,FBut Ukrainian OSINT group Truth Hounds
OL,17,Fsaid the bridge is intended "primarily
OL,18,Fto establish a covert military
OL,19,Flogistics corridor" to support Russia
OL,20,Fin the Ukraine war.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
