OL,3,ANorth Korea and Russia open first road
OL,4,Abridge linking both countries
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as relations between both
OL,7,Fcountries have grown since the start of
OL,8,Fthe Ukraine war, with Russia's Putin
OL,9,Fand North Korea's Kim Jong Un
OL,10,Fpreviously pledging that both countries
OL,11,Fwould help each other in the event of
OL,12,F"aggression" against either country.
